        {"zh": "我停在门口", "en": "I stop at the doorway."},
        {"zh": "我数你还有几步", "en": "I count the steps you have left."},
        {"zh": "你的呼吸和我的抽泣叠在一起", "en": "Your breathing overlaps my sobbing."},
